; Umbra: New Levels' labs are open to stalker squads of every faction. Bunker A1 from the start
; (New Levels never closed it). The Collider once its part of the Redemption storyline is done,
; or from the start when this player can't get that storyline (umbra_new_levels_labs.script
; gives umbra_new_levels_collider_open). New Levels waits for redemption_storyline_finished,
; which 0.53 never gives. Mutants keep their lairs; each smart has room for one more squad
; (mod_<smart>_umbra.ltx next to its config).

